steps=[('Initial Consultation','We discuss your objectives, intended use, budget considerations and preferred timing to establish the broad requirements of the project.','before.jpg'),('Site Assessment','We review the site, access, existing conditions and other practical considerations that may affect the scope and sequence of work.','civil.jpg'),('Planning and Design','We clarify the scope, coordinate relevant design requirements and consider the resources and construction sequence needed for the work.','cape-town.jpg'),('Quotation and Approval','We prepare a quotation based on the information available, discuss the proposed scope and costs, and seek approval before proceeding.','commercial.jpg'),('Construction Execution','We coordinate site activities, labour and materials against the agreed scope, keeping the client informed as the work progresses.','during.jpg'),('Quality Control and Inspection','We review workmanship during the project, inspect completed work and identify matters that need attention before handover.','pool-finishing.jpg'),('Project Handover','We undertake final checks, address agreed outstanding items and hand over the completed work to the client.','after.jpg')]
