home='''<section class="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">DESIGN <i></i> BUILD <i></i> RENOVATE <i></i> MANAGE</p><h1>Building Cape Town<br>with Quality, <em>Integrity</em><br>and <em>Precision.</em></h1><p class="intro">A trusted construction group delivering residential, commercial and industrial projects across Cape Town and the Western Cape.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn gold-btn" href="/request-a-quote/">♧ &nbsp; Request a Quote <span>→</span></a><a class="btn outline-btn" href="/our-process/">Explore Our Process</a></div></div><div class="visual-wrap"><div class="transformation" aria-label="Construction concept imagery"><div class="photo">'''+img('before.jpg','Concept image of an existing house',lazy=False)+'''<span>Before</span></div><div class="photo">'''+img('during.jpg','Concept image of construction in progress',lazy=False)+'''<span>During</span></div><div class="photo">'''+img('after.jpg','Concept image of a contemporary home',lazy=False)+'''<span>After</span></div><span class="arrow arrow-one">›</span><span class="arrow arrow-two">›</span></div><p class="visual-caption">INDEPENDENT CONCEPT IMAGES · NOT COMPANY PROJECT PHOTOGRAPHS</p></div></div><div class="hero-accent"></div></section>'''
home+=f'''<section class="section wrap">{intro('FROM VISION TO REALITY','Construction with a clear direction.','A well-executed project starts with a defined scope and continues through careful coordination on site.')}<div class="two-col"><p class="lead">From site preparation and structural work to finishing and handover, each stage calls for the right planning and attention.</p><p>We work with clients to understand the requirements of their property, coordinate the construction activities and keep the project moving toward the agreed outcome. <a class="text-link" href="/our-process/">How we work →</a></p></div></section><section class="section pale"><div class="wrap split"><div class="split-image">{img('during.jpg','Construction concept: active site')}<span class="image-note">BUILT WITH PURPOSE</span></div><div><p class="kicker gold">ABOUT STRATEGIC</p><h2>Building Beyond<br>Expectations.</h2><p class="lead">Good construction begins with a clear brief, careful planning and attention to the details that shape the finished property.</p><p>Strategic Construction Group provides construction services for residential, commercial and industrial properties in Cape Town and the Western Cape. We work through the scope with our clients, coordinate site activities and keep quality and communication central to delivery.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know us →</a></div></div></section><section class="section wrap">{intro('WHAT WE DO','Built around your needs.','From the first idea to the final details, our services are designed around the requirements of your project.')}{cards()}</section><section class="section navy"><div class="wrap">{intro('THE STRATEGIC DIFFERENCE','A considered approach to every detail.','We believe a successful build is grounded in care, collaboration and clear communication.')}<div class="value-grid">{''.join(f'<div><span>{i:02d}</span><h3>{v}</h3><p>{t}</p></div>' for i,(v,t) in enumerate([('Quality workmanship','A careful approach to the work at every stage.'),('Professional project management','Coordination shaped around the project scope.'),('Safety-conscious construction','Consideration for people and site conditions.'),('Transparent communication','Clear conversations throughout the process.'),('Attention to detail','Thoughtful execution from planning to finishing.'),('Reliable project execution','A structured approach to the agreed work.')],1))}</div></div></section><section class="section wrap">{intro('HOW WE WORK','A clear path from idea to handover.','Every build is different. Our process provides a practical framework for moving forward.') }<div class="process-strip">{''.join(f'<div><b>{i:02d}</b><h3>{s[0]}</h3></div>' for i,s in enumerate(steps,1))}</div><div class="center"><a class="btn dark-btn" href="/our-process/">Discover our process →</a></div></section>{cta()}'''
paths.append(render('/','Construction Company Cape Town','Residential, commercial and industrial construction solutions in Cape Town and the Western Cape.',home))
about=banner('Building Trust Through Quality Construction.','Strategic Construction Group approaches construction with care, collaboration and a commitment to quality across Cape Town.','during.jpg','ABOUT US')+f'''<section class="section wrap split"><div><p class="kicker gold">WHO WE ARE</p><h2>Building with purpose. Working with you.</h2><p class="lead">Strategic Construction Group provides building and construction services for clients across Cape Town and the Western Cape.</p><p>Our services cover residential, commercial and industrial construction, renovations, civil works and project management. Whether a project involves a new building or an existing property, we begin by understanding the requirements and agreeing on the scope before coordinating the work.</p></div><div class="split-image">{img('civil.jpg','Construction concept: earthworks')}</div></section><section class="section pale"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><p class="kicker gold">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Build with care.</h2><p>To deliver quality construction services through professional execution, responsible project management and solutions focused on our clients.</p></div><div><p class="kicker gold">OUR VISION</p><h2>A trusted partner.</h2><p>To become a trusted construction partner in Cape Town and the wider Western Cape, known for a considered approach to every project.</p></div></div></section><section class="section wrap">{intro('WHAT GUIDES US','Our values.','The principles we bring to our work and our relationships.')}<div class="value-grid light-values">{''.join(f'<div><span>{i:02d}</span><h3>{v}</h3></div>' for i,v in enumerate(['Quality','Integrity','Safety','Accountability','Professionalism','Client Satisfaction'],1))}</div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="narrow"><p class="kicker gold">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>Every project begins with understanding.</h2><p>We start with the client’s objectives, the site and the proposed scope. Once the work has been agreed, we plan the construction sequence, coordinate resources and monitor progress on site. Inspection and the resolution of outstanding work support the final handover.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-process/">Explore our process →</a></div></section>{cta('Have a Project in Mind?','Tell us what you are planning and start a conversation.','Talk to Our Team')}'''
paths.append(render('/about/','About Us','Learn about Strategic Construction Group’s client-focused approach to construction in Cape Town.',about))
