faq=[('What construction services do you offer?','Our services cover residential, commercial and industrial construction, renovations and extensions, civil works, project management, design and build, and maintenance. The exact work is confirmed for each project.'),('Which areas do you serve?','We work across Cape Town and the wider Western Cape. Please include the site location in your enquiry so that the requirements and access can be considered.'),('How do I request a construction quotation?','Prepare a project brief using the quote form, including the location, scope, budget and preferred timing. The form currently downloads your brief and does not send it to our team.'),('Can I follow construction progress?','Yes. The appropriate form and frequency of progress updates can be discussed when the project scope and management arrangements are agreed.'),('Do you undertake renovations?','Yes. We undertake renovations and extensions, including interior upgrades and alterations to existing buildings. The scope depends on the condition of the property and the proposed work.'),('How does the construction process work?','We begin with consultation and site assessment, followed by planning and quotation. Once the scope is approved, the work proceeds through construction, inspection and handover. The sequence is adjusted to suit the project.')]
